{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>And in your seed shall all the nations of the earth be blessed.</b> When all of them call upon the name of YHWH to serve Him with one accord, they shall all be blessed through your seed and strive to resemble them." "<b>Because you obeyed My voice.</b> The reward for a commandment is itself a commandment — so that through this you merit that the prophets of your children become a banner for the nations, instructing the gentiles in the worship of the blessed El, and to you it shall be accounted as righteousness."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:31:08.333222344Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}